<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram id="ingestion-system-flow" name="수집 시스템 플로우"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2100" pageHeight="8162" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="c2" value="&lt;b&gt;데이터 수집·게시 시스템 플로우 — Seed → 가상 데이터 생성 → Bronze 적재 → Warehouse 게시 → Metabase 서빙**&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="2040" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="범례: 실선 화살표 = 쓰기(→ 저장소) · 점선 화살표 = 읽기(저장소 →) · 마름모 = 분기 · 상자 색 = 단계(Seed 청록, Generator 파랑, Airflow 주황, Ingestion 초록, Warehouse 보라, Reprocess 분홍) · 빨간 박스 = 실패·차단, 회색 박스 = 정상 분기 종료, 저장소 칸 안의 색 박스 = 읽기/쓰기 대상 · 빨간 점선 = 이전 단계로 복귀(재시도·반복·재수집) · 파란 점선 = 구간 간 연결 · Lease = 임대 잠금 · Watermark = 증분 수집 위치 · Airflow/Generator/Ingestion/Warehouse N = 해당 구간의 N번째 단계(a·b·c는 하위 단계)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#555555;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="50" width="2040" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="PostgreSQL&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;pipeline_metadata&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;opacity=45;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="740" y="92" width="200" height="8070.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="PostgreSQL&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;commerce_source&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;opacity=45;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="960" y="92" width="200" height="8070.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="로컬 파일 시스템&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;(CSV 입력 · 임시 Parquet)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fillColor=#e0e0e0;strokeColor=#808080;opacity=45;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1180" y="92" width="200" height="8070.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="SeaweedFS (S3)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Bronze / Quarantine&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;opacity=45;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1400" y="92" width="200" height="8070.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="DuckDB 파일&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;data/warehouse · /serving&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;opacity=45;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1620" y="92" width="200" height="8070.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="Metabase&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;(REST API)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;opacity=45;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1840" y="92" width="200" height="8070.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="&lt;b&gt;0. 선행 준비 — Seed (python -m src.seed, 최초 1회)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=730;fillColor=#d0efef;strokeColor=#3f9c9c;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="130" width="2040" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c36" value="&lt;b&gt;A. 가상 데이터 생성 — source_simulation_dag (SOURCE_DAG_SCHEDULE, 기본 @hourly)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=730;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="827.0" width="2040" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c98" value="&lt;b&gt;B. Airflow 연결 — warehouse_pipeline_dag (schedule=None, max_active_runs=1)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=730;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="2385.0" width="2040" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c111" value="&lt;b&gt;C. 변경분 수집 — ingest_table() 13단계 (Table 1개 기준, src/ingestion/service.py)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=730;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="2863.0" width="2040" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c184" value="&lt;b&gt;D. 변환·게시·서빙 — verify_bronze_commit 이후 (warehouse_pipeline_dag)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=730;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="4628.0" width="2040" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c293" value="&lt;b&gt;E. 보조 경로 — 재처리 (python -m src.ingestion.reprocess) 와 Replay Build&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=730;fillColor=#f3d1e8;strokeColor=#b0488f;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="7288.0" width="2040" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;fontSize=11;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c11" target="c14"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;fontSize=11;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c14" target="c18"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value="예" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;fontSize=11;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c18" target="c24"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c29" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classic;fontSize=11;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c24" target="c28"><mxGeometry relative="1" 