X=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c317" target="c319"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="&lt;b&gt;Seed 1. 입력 CSV 읽기·검증&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;build_seed_dataset — 파일 checksum 확인, PK·참조 무결성 검사" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#d0efef;strokeColor=#3f9c9c;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="210" width="420" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="Olist CSV&lt;br&gt;(input_dir)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#e0e0e0;strokeColor=#808080;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1190" y="218" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="&lt;b&gt;Seed 2. 스키마 보장&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Source 테이블 DDL 3개와 Seed 메타(seed_runs) DDL 적용" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#d0efef;strokeColor=#3f9c9c;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="296" width="420" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="Source 테이블 DDL&lt;br&gt;(없으면 생성)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="970" y="304" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="&lt;b&gt;Seed 3. Seed 가능한 상태인가?&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rhombus;fillColor=#d0efef;strokeColor=#3f9c9c;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="382" width="420" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note-c18" value="성공한 Generator Run이 이미 있거나, 기존 성공 Seed와 checksum·seeded_at이 다르면 차단" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="535" y="484.0" width="190" height="49" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="generator_runs ·&lt;br&gt;seed_runs 조회" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="411.5" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="Seed 차단&lt;br&gt;(ValueError)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="409.5" width="190" height="44" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="&lt;b&gt;Seed 4. Run 시작 기록&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;적재 트랜잭션과 분리해 먼저 Commit" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#d0efef;strokeColor=#3f9c9c;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="563.0" width="420" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value="seed_runs INSERT&lt;br&gt;(RUNNING)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="571.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c28" value="&lt;b&gt;Seed 5. Source 단일 트랜잭션 적재&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;LOAD_ORDER 순서로 테이블별 UPSERT 후 행 수·내용 Hash 계산 — 실패 시 전체 롤백" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#d0efef;strokeColor=#3f9c9c;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="649.0" width="420" height="59" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c30" value="테이블별 UPSERT&lt;br&gt;행 수·Hash 계산" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="970" y="658.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c32" value="&lt;b&gt;Seed 6. 완료 기록&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;성공: SUCCESS + 테이블별 행 수·Hash / 실패: FAILED + 오류 메시지. 이 checksum·seeded_at이 Generator의 Snapshot ID가 됨" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#d0efef;strokeColor=#3f9c9c;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="738.0" width="420" height="59" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c34" value="seed_runs 갱신&lt;br&gt;(SUCCESS / FAILED)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="747.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c37" value="&lt;b&gt;Airflow 1. run_source_simulation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Params(seed·orders·anomaly_profile 등)로 GeneratorConfig를 만들어 run_generator 호출. 재시도 불가 오류는 AirflowFailException, 재시도 가능 오류는 Airflow가 다시 실행" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="907.0" width="420" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c38" value="&lt;b&gt;Generator 1. Seed Snapshot ID 검증&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;최근 성공 Seed의 checksum·seeded_at으로 기대 ID 계산, config와 다르면 중단" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="1011.0" width="420" height="59" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c40" value="seed_runs 조회&lt;br&gt;(SUCCESS 최신)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="1020.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c42" value="&lt;b&gt;Generator 2. Generator·Lease 메타 테이블 보장&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;ensure_generator_metadata / ensure_source_mutation_lease_metadata" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="1100.0" width="420" height="59" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c44" value="메타 테이블 생성&lt;br&gt;(없으면)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="1109.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c46" value="&lt;b&gt;Generator 3. 동일 결정성 입력의 성공 Run이 있는가?&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rhombus;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="1189.0" width="420" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note-c46" value="source_snapshot_id·random_seed·logical_date·order_count·anomaly_profile·generator_version·progress_time_scale 7개 비교" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="535" y="1291.0" width="190" height="75" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c48" value="generator_runs 조회" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="1220.0" width="180" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c50" value="기존 결과 재사용&lt;br&gt;(reused=True) 후 종료" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#e0e0e0;strokeColor=#808080;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1217.0" width="190" height="44" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c52" value="&lt;b&gt;Generator 4. Source Mutation Lease 획득 (GENERATOR)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Warehouse 수집 중이면 LeaseUnavailableError(재시도 가능) — Airflow가 최대 2회, 60초부터 지수 백오프로 Task를 다시 실행" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="1396.0" width="420" height="59" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c54" value="source_mutation_leases&lt;br&gt;GENERATOR Lease 획득" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="1405.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c56" value="&lt;b&gt;Generator 5. 이미 Source에 Commit된 Run인가?&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rhombus;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="1485.0" width="420" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note-c56" value="ensure_generator_commits로 Source에 마커 테이블을 보장한 뒤 조회 — 중복 적용 방지" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="535" y="1587.0" width="190" height="49" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c58" value="generator_commits 조회&lt;br&gt;(Source DB)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="970" y="1514.5" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c60" value="generator_runs를 SUCCESS로&lt;br&gt;기록 후 재사용 종료" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#e0e0e0;strokeColor=#808080;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1512.5" width="190" height="44" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c62" value="&lt;b&gt;Generator 6. Run 시작 기록&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;record_started_run" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="1666.0" width="420" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c64" value="generator_runs에&lt;br&gt;Run 시작 기록" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="1674.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c66" value="&lt;b&gt;Generator 7. Source 트랜잭션 시작 + 커서 전진 검증&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;7개 변경 테이블의 cursor 최댓값 &amp;lt; logical_date 이어야 함 (아니면 SourceCursorRegressionError)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="1755.0" width="420" height="59" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c68" value="MAX(cursor 컬럼) 조회" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="970" y="1765.0" width="180" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c70" value="커서 후퇴 → SourceCursorRegressionError&lt;br&gt;generator_runs FAILED, Lease 해제" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1751.0" width="190" height="66" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c72" value="&lt;b&gt;Generator 8. 기존 주문 상태 전이&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;run_existing_order_transitions" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="1848.0" width="420" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c74" value="기존 주문·결제&lt;br&gt;상태 UPDATE" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="970" y="1856.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c76" value="&lt;b&gt;Generator 9. 신규 주문 생성&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;create_new_orders (order_count 건)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="1934.0" width="420" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c78" value="orders · order_items ·&lt;br&gt;order_payments INSERT" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="970" y="1942.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c80" value="&lt;b&gt;Generator 10. 구독 만료 스캔 + anomaly_profile 적용&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;구독 결제 실패 · 등급 변경 · 구독 상태 전이 (profile에 따라)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="2020.0" width="420" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c82" value="구독·결제·등급&lt;br&gt;INSERT / UPDATE" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="970" y="2028.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c84" value="&lt;b&gt;Generator 11. 논리 Hash 계산 + Commit 증적 기록&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;logical_hash, record_source_commit — Source 변경과 같은 트랜잭션" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="2106.0" width="420" height="59" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c86" value="generator_commits INSERT&lt;br&gt;(같은 트랜잭션)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="970" y="2115.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c88" value="&lt;b&gt;Generator 12. Lease 고정 후 Source COMMIT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;fenced_source_commit — Lease 행에 공유 잠금을 걸고 소유권을 확인, Source COMMIT이 끝날 때까지 유지. Lease를 잃었으면 Commit 실패" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="2195.0" width="420" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c90" value="Lease 행 SHARE 잠금&lt;br&gt;+ 소유권 검증" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="2212.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c92" value="Lease 상실 → Source 트랜잭션 롤백&lt;br&gt;generator_runs FAILED" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="2206.0" width="190" height="53" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c94" value="&lt;b&gt;Generator 13. Run 성공 기록 + Lease 해제&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;예외 시 FAILED 기록 후 Lease 해제" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="2299.0" width="420" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c96" value="generator_runs SUCCESS&lt;br&gt;Lease 해제" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="2307.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c99" value="&lt;b&gt;Airflow 2. trigger_warehouse_pipeline&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;source_simulation_dag의 마지막 Task — 완료를 기다리지 않고(wait_for_completion=False) Trigger. 같은 logical_date Run이 있으면 건너뛰고, DAG가 일시정지면 실패" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="2465.0" width="420" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c101" value="&lt;b&gt;Airflow 3. initialize_run&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;logical_date(UTC)로 표준 batch_id 생성 — DB 기록 없음" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="2569.0" width="420" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c103" value="&lt;b&gt;Airflow 4. acquire_source_snapshot_lease&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;WAREHOUSE 소유자로 Source Mutation Lease 획득, Lease Token만 다음 Task로 전달" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="2655.0" width="420" height="59" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c105" value="source_mutation_leases&lt;br&gt;WAREHOUSE Lease 획득" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="2664.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c107" value="Generator가 Lease 보유 중 →&lt;br&gt;LEASE_UNAVAILABLE (재시도 가능)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="2658.0" width="190" height="53" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c109" value="&lt;b&gt;Airflow 5. extract_validate_load&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;9개 Table을 mapped Task로 동시 3개까지 실행 — Table마다 ingest_table() 호출: customers · customer_subscriptions · customer_membership_tiers · subscription_payments · products · sellers · orders · order_items · order_payments" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="2744.0" width="420" height="89" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c112" value="&lt;b&gt;Ingestion 1. 버킷 확인&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;ensure_bucket — head_bucket 후 없을 때만 생성" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="2943.0" width="420" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c114" value="버킷 확인 / 생성" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1410" y="2952.0" width="180" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c116" value="&lt;b&gt;Ingestion 2. Watermark 조회 또는 생성&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;ensure_ingestion_metadata 후 어디까지 읽었는지(cursor, version) 확보" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="3029.0" width="420" height="59" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c118" value="watermarks 조회&lt;br&gt;(없으면 INSERT)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="3038.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c120" value="&lt;b&gt;Ingestion 3. 같은 배치가 이미 COMMITTED인가?&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rhombus;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="3128.0" width="420" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note-c120" value="멱등성 — 범위가 같으면 건너뛰고, 다르면 Source를 읽기 전에 충돌로 종료" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="535" y="3230.0" width="190" height="49" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c122" value="bronze_objects 조회&lt;br&gt;(COMMITTED)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="3157.5" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c124" value="같음: SKIPPED_ALREADY_COMMITTED&lt;br&gt;다름: BATCH_IDENTITY_CONFLICT&lt;br&gt;(둘 다 pipeline_runs에 기록)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#e0e0e0;strokeColor=#808080;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="3138.5" width="190" height="79" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c126" value="&lt;b&gt;Ingestion 4. Source Lease 검증 + Table Lease 획득&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;넘겨받은 Source Lease를 검증(없으면 직접 획득)하고 Table Lease를 획득" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="3328.0" width="420" height="59" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c128" value="watermarks의&lt;br&gt;lease_owner·만료 기록" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="3337.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c130" value="Lease 획득 실패 → pipeline_runs에&lt;br&gt;FAILED 기록 후 중단&lt;br&gt;(직접 잡은 Source Lease는 해제)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="3318.0" width="190" height="79" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c132" value="&lt;b&gt;Ingestion 5. Heartbeat 시작 + Snapshot 열기&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;백그라운드 Heartbeat가 두 Lease 만료 시각을 주기적으로 연장. REPEATABLE READ 읽기 전용으로 Watermark 이후를 읽고 extract_upper_bound를 고정" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="3426.0" width="420" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c134" value="읽기 전용 Snapshot&lt;br&gt;upper bound 조회" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="970" y="3443.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c136" value="&lt;b&gt;Ingestion 6. Run 시작 기록&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;record_started_run (watermark_before, extract_upper_bound)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="3530.0" width="420" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c138" value="pipeline_runs INSERT&lt;br&gt;(RUNNING)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="3538.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c140" value="&lt;b&gt;Ingestion 7. 읽을 변경분이 있는가?&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rhombus;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="3616.0" width="420" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note-c140" value="extract_upper_bound가 None이면 변경분 없음" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="535" y="3718.0" width="190" height="36" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c142" value="(없으면) pipeline_runs&lt;br&gt;SUCCESS_NO_DATA" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="3646.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c144" value="SUCCESS_NO_DATA&lt;br&gt;기록 후 종료" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#e0e0e0;strokeColor=#808080;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="3644.0" width="190" height="44" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c146" value="&lt;b&gt;Ingestion 8a. Page 단위로 변경분 읽기&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;snapshot.pages() — 부모 참조 검사를 위해 부모 테이블도 같은 Snapshot에서 조회" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="3784.0" width="420" height="59" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c148" value="Page 조회" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="970" y="3794.0" width="180" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c150" value="&lt;b&gt;Ingestion 8b. 행별 검증&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;ValidationPipeline + Parent 참조 검사 → 합격 / 불합격 분류 (메모리)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="3873.0" width="420" height="59" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c152" value="&lt;b&gt;Ingestion 8c. 합격 행 → Bronze 로컬 Parquet&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;TableBronzeWriter" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="3962.0" width="420" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c154" value="{run_id}.parquet" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#e0e0e0;strokeColor=#808080;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1190" y="3971.0" width="180" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c156" value="&lt;b&gt;Ingestion 8d. 불합격 행 → Quarantine 로컬 Parquet&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;불합격 행이 있을 때만 생성" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="4048.0" width="420" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c158" value="{run_id}.quarantine&lt;br&gt;.parquet" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#e0e0e0;strokeColor=#808080;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1190" y="4056.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c160" value="&lt;b&gt;Ingestion 9. Lease 재확인 + 불합격률 검사&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;assert_source_mutation_lease / assert_table_lease / assert_reject_rate" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="4134.0" width="420" height="59" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c162" value="Lease 유효성 검증" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="4144.0" width="180" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c164" value="한도 초과 시 예외&lt;br&gt;Run 실패 기록,&lt;br&gt;Watermark 전진 없음" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="4137.0" width="190" height="53" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c166" value="&lt;b&gt;Ingestion 10. Quarantine 업로드 (있을 때만)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;SHA-256 계산 → 새 Final Key에만 업로드 → HEAD로 크기·Hash 검증 → manifest.json 업로드" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="4223.0" width="420" height="59" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c168" value="quarantine/.../&lt;br&gt;records.parquet&lt;br&gt;+ manifest.json" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1410" y="4226.0" width="180" height="53" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c170" value="&lt;b&gt;Ingestion 11. Bronze 업로드&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;같은 방식으로 업로드 + 로컬 파일에서 논리 Hash 계산 → manifest.json에 기록" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="4312.0" width="420" height="59" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c172" value="bronze/.../&lt;br&gt;data.parquet&lt;br&gt;+ manifest.json" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1410" y="4315.0" width="180" height="53" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c174" value="&lt;b&gt;Ingestion 12. Lease 재확인 후 commit_table_run&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;한 트랜잭션: watermarks 행 FOR UPDATE로 Lease 확인 → 격리 배치 → Bronze 객체 COMMITTED → Run SUCCESS → Watermark CAS. 여기서 비로소 Bronze 확정" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="4403.0" width="420" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c176" value="quarantine_batches&lt;br&gt;bronze_objects (COMMITTED)&lt;br&gt;pipeline_runs SUCCESS&lt;br&gt;watermarks CAS 전진" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="4401.0" width="180" height="79" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c178" value="Lease 상실·Watermark 충돌 →&lt;br&gt;트랜잭션 롤백, Run FAILED" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="4418.0" width="190" height="44" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c180" value="&lt;b&gt;Ingestion 13. 정리 (finally, 성공·실패 공통)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;테이블 Lease 해제, 직접 잡은 경우에만 Source Lease 해제 (DAG에서는 Warehouse 1이 해제). 재시도 가능 오류(Source 연결·Lease·S3 429/5xx)였다면 Airflow가 Task를 다시 실행(최대 2회) — 이미 COMMITTED면 Ingestion 3에서 건너뜀" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="4509.0" width="420" height="89" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c182" value="임시 Parquet 삭제" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#e0e0e0;strokeColor=#808080;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1190" y="4534.0" width="180" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c185" value="&lt;b&gt;Warehouse 1. release_source_snapshot_lease (all_done)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;모든 extract 종료 후 Source Lease 해제 — 아래 verify와 병렬 실행" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="4708.0" width="420" height="59" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c187" value="source_mutation_leases&lt;br&gt;Lease 해제" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="4717.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c189" value="&lt;b&gt;Warehouse 2. verify_bronze_commit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;9개 Table 각각 COMMITTED 배치 또는 SUCCESS_NO_DATA인지, schema_version이 계약과 같은지 확인. 하나라도 틀리면 실패하고 이후 단계는 실행되지 않음" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="4797.0" width="420" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c191" value="bronze_objects ·&lt;br&gt;pipeline_runs 조회" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="4814.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c193" value="COMMITTED 누락·schema_version&lt;br&gt;불일치 → Task 실패,&lt;br&gt;이후 Task 중단" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="4801.0" width="190" height="66" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c195" value="&lt;b&gt;Warehouse 3a. prepare_warehouse_build — 게시 Run 시작&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;5분(PUBLISH_LEASE) 넘게 heartbeat 없는 잔재를 먼저 정리(PUBLISHING 중 죽은 Run은 Published 파일 inode·mtime이 기록과 같으면 게시 완료로, 아니면 실패로 마감). 활성 Run이 이미 있으면 PublishInProgressError" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="4901.0" width="420" height="89" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c197" value="mart_publish_runs&lt;br&gt;BUILDING 행 INSERT" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="4925.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c199" value="활성 게시 Run이 있으면&lt;br&gt;PublishInProgressError" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="4923.0" width="190" height="44" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c201" value="&lt;b&gt;Warehouse 3b. Published 파일을 Build 파일로 복사&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Published에 WAL이 있으면 PublishedWalError. warehouse.duckdb → build/{publish_run_id}.duckdb (최초에는 복사할 파일 없음)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="5020.0" width="420" height="59" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c203" value="build/{publish_run_id}&lt;br&gt;.duckdb" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1630" y="5029.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c205" value="Published WAL 존재 →&lt;br&gt;PublishedWalError,&lt;br&gt;Run FAILED" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="5023.0" width="190" height="53" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c207" value="&lt;b&gt;Warehouse 3c. Bronze Catalog 동기화 (sync_bronze_catalog)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PostgreSQL bronze_objects의 COMMITTED 목록으로 Build의 control.bronze_files를 한 트랜잭션에서 통째로 교체 — dbt가 읽을 Bronze 목록" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="5109.0" width="420" height="89" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c209" value="control.bronze_files&lt;br&gt;(COMMITTED만)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1630" y="5133.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c211" value="&lt;b&gt;Warehouse 4a. dbt build 시작 — on-run-start 훅&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;WAREHOUSE_PATH=Build 파일, --vars로 Bronze 스키마 계약 전달. bronze_as_of 사용 시 --full-refresh 필수 검사, 재계산 경계·Replay 증적 테이블 준비 (retries=0)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="5228.0" width="420" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c213" value="control.dbt_processed_batch&lt;br&gt;control.dbt_replay_boundary" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1630" y="5232.0" width="180" height="66" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c215" value="&lt;b&gt;Warehouse 4b. Bronze 읽기 — bronze_source 매크로&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Build의 control.bronze_files에서 object_key·schema_version 조회, 계약 버전 확인 후 read_parquet" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="5332.0" width="420" height="59" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c217" value="COMMITTED Parquet&lt;br&gt;(read_parquet)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1410" y="5341.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c219" value="&lt;b&gt;Warehouse 4c. 모델 생성 + 테스트&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;staging → intermediate → marts 순서, 모델 직후 해당 테스트 실행. 실패 모델의 하위는 skip. Published 파일은 건드리지 않음" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="5421.0" width="420" height="59" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c221" value="Build 파일에&lt;br&gt;모델·테스트 결과" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1630" y="5430.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c223" value="&lt;b&gt;Warehouse 4d. dbt build 종료 — on-run-end 훅&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;영향 Key를 control.affected_keys에 기록. Fact 4개를 모두 빌드했고 실패·skip이 없으며 Replay 경계가 없을 때만 처리 완료 batch를 전진" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="5510.0" width="420" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c225" value="control.affected_keys&lt;br&gt;control.dbt_processed_batch" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1630" y="5521.0" width="180" height="53" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c227" value="&lt;b&gt;Warehouse 4e. dbt 결과 기록&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;record_dbt_result — invocation_id, tests_passed, tests_failed" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="5614.0" width="420" height="59" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c229" value="mart_publish_runs에&lt;br&gt;dbt 결과 기록" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="5623.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c231" value="&lt;b&gt;Warehouse 4f. dbt build가 성공했는가?&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rhombus;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="5706.0" width="420" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note-c231" value="종료 코드 0이고 error·fail 노드가 없으면 성공 — 테스트 warn은 통과로 취급. 품질 Gate" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="535" y="5808.0" width="190" height="49" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c233" value="(실패 시) Build → failed/&lt;br&gt;격리, 최근 3개만 보존" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1630" y="5735.5" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c235" value="mart_publish_runs FAILED 기록&lt;br&gt;기존 Published 유지&lt;br&gt;예외로 이후 Task 중단" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="5722.5" width="190" height="66" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c237" value="&lt;b&gt;Warehouse 5a. publish_mart — CHECKPOINT·WAL 확인·Hash 계산&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Build CHECKPOINT 후 WAL 없음 확인, Mart별 Hash·행 수 계산, 파일 Identity(inode·mtime) 기록 준비" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="5891.0" width="420" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c239" value="Build 파일 읽기&lt;br&gt;(Mart별 Hash·행 수)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1630" y="5908.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c241" value="WAL 잔존·Hash 계산·교체 중 오류 →&lt;br&gt;Build가 남아 있으면 FAILED 기록·격리" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="5895.0" width="190" height="66" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c243" value="&lt;b&gt;Warehouse 5b. PUBLISHING 기록&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;mark_publishing — Hash·행 수·파일 Identity 저장" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="5995.0" width="420" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c245" value="mart_publish_runs&lt;br&gt;PUBLISHING +&lt;br&gt;Hash·행 수·Identity" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="5997.0" width="180" height="53" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c247" value="&lt;b&gt;Warehouse 5c. Published 파일 원자 교체&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;os.replace(build → warehouse.duckdb) + 디렉터리 fsync. 이 순간 Build 파일이 새 Published가 됨" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="6081.0" width="420" height="59" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c249" value="warehouse.duckdb ← Build&lt;br&gt;(Atomic 교체)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1630" y="6090.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c251" value="&lt;b&gt;Warehouse 5d. PUBLISHED 기록&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;mark_published, 직전 PUBLISHED Run의 Hash와 비교해 바뀐 relation 계산, dbt target 폴더 삭제" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="6170.0" width="420" height="59" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c253" value="mart_publish_runs&lt;br&gt;PUBLISHED" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="6179.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c255" value="&lt;b&gt;Warehouse 6a. export_serving_mart — Mart 복사·검증&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;게시 파일 Identity가 이번 게시와 같은지 확인 → Mart 테이블 독립 복사 → manifest 기록 → 검증 → CHECKPOINT. 실패해도 Publish는 유지(SERVING_EXPORT_FAILED)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="6259.0" width="420" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c257" value="serving build 파일에&lt;br&gt;Mart 복사 + manifest" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1630" y="6276.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c259" value="Export 실패 → SERVING_EXPORT_FAILED&lt;br&gt;(Publish는 유지, 이후 Task 중단)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="6263.0" width="190" height="66" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c261" value="&lt;b&gt;Warehouse 6b. Serving 파일 교체&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;exports/{export_id}.duckdb 하드링크 생성 후 serving 파일을 원자 교체 (교체 직전 Identity 재확인)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="6363.0" width="420" height="59" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c263" value="/serving/exports/&lt;br&gt;{export_id}.duckdb" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1630" y="6372.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c265" value="&lt;b&gt;Warehouse 7a. repoint_metabase_serving — 연결 경로 재지정&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;URL·API Key·DB ID 중 하나라도 없으면 SKIPPED" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="6452.0" width="420" height="59" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c267" value="PUT database_file =&lt;br&gt;/serving/exports/{id}.duckdb" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1850" y="6455.0" width="180" height="53" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c269" value="&lt;b&gt;Warehouse 7b. Metabase manifest의 export_id가 새 Export와 같은가?&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rhombus;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="6541.0" width="420" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note-c269" value="다르면 재지정 실패로 처리 (AirflowException)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="535" y="6663.0" width="190" height="36" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c271" value="serving manifest&lt;br&gt;export_id 조회" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1850" y="6580.5" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c273" value="FAILED — 이전 Export 파일 보존&lt;br&gt;(정리 건너뜀)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="6574.5" width="190" height="53" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c275" value="&lt;b&gt;Warehouse 7c. 스키마 동기화 요청&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;실패해도 경고만 — 재지정은 성공, 정기 Sync가 반영" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="6729.0" width="420" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c277" value="POST sync_schema" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1850" y="6738.0" width="180" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c279" value="&lt;b&gt;Warehouse 7d. 오래된 Export 정리&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;재지정 SUCCESS 또는 SKIPPED일 때만 최근 3개 남기고 삭제" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="6815.0" width="420" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c281" value="exports/ 최근 3개 유지" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1630" y="6824.0" width="180" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c283" value="&lt;b&gt;Warehouse 8a. publish_run_summary (all_done) — 지표 수집&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;probe 10종: DagRun 시간, Task 상태, Table별 최신 Run, 잔존 Lease, Bronze 객체 수, 진행 중 게시, Metabase 최신 여부, 최신 주문 시각(fct_order), 행 수, 파일·디스크. 한 probe가 실패해도 나머지는 계속" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="6901.0" width="420" height="104" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c285" value="pipeline_runs · watermarks ·&lt;br&gt;source_mutation_leases ·&lt;br&gt;bronze_objects ·&lt;br&gt;mart_publish_runs 조회" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="6914.0" width="180" height="79" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c287" value="&lt;b&gt;Warehouse 8b. 판정 (judge_run_report)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;TASK_NOT_SUCCESS · PUBLISH_* · SERVING_EXPORT_FAILED · REPOINT_* · NOT_FRESH · DATA_STALE(지연 &amp;gt; 주기×2) · ROW_COUNT_DROP(1% 초과 감소) · EXPORTS_COUNT_n · FAILED_BUILDS_OVER_RETENTION · BUILD_DIR_NOT_EMPTY · LEASE_HELD · SLOW_RUN(600초 이상) · PROBE_ERROR" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="7035.0" width="420" height="104" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c289" value="&lt;b&gt;Warehouse 8c. Run Report 기록&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;dag_run_id 기준 UPSERT. 저장 실패는 로그만 남기고 DAG는 실패시키지 않음. 이후 source_simulation_dag의 다음 주기가 처음부터 반복 — 실패한 주기는 Watermark가 전진하지 않아 같은 범위를 다시 읽고, 실패한 게시는 마지막 Published에서 다시 시작" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="7169.0" width="420" height="89" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c291" value="warehouse_run_reports&lt;br&gt;UPSERT" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="7193.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c294" value="&lt;b&gt;Reprocess 1. 되감기 목표 Cursor 계산&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;--tables와 --reprocess-from(UTC)을 받아 경계 시각 직전의 마지막 Cursor를 구함" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#f3d1e8;strokeColor=#b0488f;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="7368.0" width="420" height="59" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c295" value="경계 직전 마지막 Cursor&lt;br&gt;(REPEATABLE READ)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="970" y="7377.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c297" value="&lt;b&gt;Reprocess 2. 현재 Watermark 조회&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Table마다 &amp;lt;table&amp;gt;_bronze 파이프라인 이름으로 조회" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#f3d1e8;strokeColor=#b0488f;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="7457.0" width="420" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c299" value="watermarks 조회&lt;br&gt;(없으면 INSERT)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="7465.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c301" value="&lt;b&gt;Reprocess 3. --dry-run 인가?&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rhombus;fillColor=#f3d1e8;strokeColor=#b0488f;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="7543.0" width="420" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note-c301" value="dry-run이면 메타를 쓰지 않음" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="535" y="7645.0" width="190" height="23" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c303" value="현재→목표 Cursor만&lt;br&gt;JSON 출력 후 종료" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#e0e0e0;strokeColor=#808080;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="7571.0" width="190" height="44" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c305" value="&lt;b&gt;Reprocess 4. Table Lease 획득&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Table마다 새 owner_id로 획득" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#f3d1e8;strokeColor=#b0488f;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="7698.0" width="420" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c307" value="watermarks의&lt;br&gt;Table Lease 획득" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="7706.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c309" value="&lt;b&gt;Reprocess 5. Watermark 되감기&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Lease 소유자이고 version이 같을 때만, 현재보다 과거 Cursor로만 허용(CAS)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#f3d1e8;strokeColor=#b0488f;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="7784.0" width="420" height="59" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c311" value="watermarks Cursor 과거로&lt;br&gt;version + 1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="7793.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c313" value="&lt;b&gt;Reprocess 6. Lease 해제 + 결과 JSON 출력&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;finally에서 항상 해제" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#f3d1e8;strokeColor=#b0488f;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="7873.0" width="420" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c315" value="Table Lease 해제" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="7882.0" width="180" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c317" value="&lt;b&gt;Reprocess 7. 다음 warehouse_pipeline_dag 실행이 경계 이후를 재수집&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;기존 Bronze 객체는 수정하지 않고 새 객체로 추가 (불변 원칙)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#f3d1e8;strokeColor=#b0488f;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="7959.0" width="420" height="59" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c319" value="&lt;b&gt;Replay Build. 특정 시점 기준 재계산&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;dbt var bronze_as_of(UTC ISO-8601) 지정 시 committed_at ≤ 경계인 Bronze만 읽음. --full-refresh 필수, 처리 완료 batch는 전진하지 않음" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#f3d1e8;strokeColor=#b0488f;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="8048.0" width="420" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c321" value="control.bronze_files&lt;br&gt;committed_at ≤ 경계" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1630" y="8065.0" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=classic;dashed=1;strokeColor=#333333;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c12" target="c11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=classic;strokeColor=#333333;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c14" target="c16"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=classic;dashed=1;strokeColor=#333333;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c20" target="c18"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="아니오" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=classic;dashed=1;fontSize=11;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c18" target="c22"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c27" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=classic;strokeColor=#333333;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c24" target="c26"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c31" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=classic;strokeColor=#333333;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c28" target="c30"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c35" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=classic;strokeColor=#333333;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c32" target="c34"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c41" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=classic;dashed=1;strokeColor=#333333;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c40" target="c38"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c45" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=classic;strokeColor=#333333;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c42" target="c44"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c49" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=classic;dashed=1;strokeColor=#333333;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c48" target="c46"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c51" value="예" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=classic;dashed=1;fontSize=11;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;entryX=1;entryY=0